                                    <decoDesc>
                                      <decoNote type="miniature" xml:id="d1"><locus target="#iv(erso)" facs="003"> f. iv(erso) upper left</locus><desc><ref type="authFile" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/AT1002Annunciation">Annunciation</ref></desc></decoNote>
                                      <decoNote type="miniature" xml:id="d2"><locus target="#iv(erso)" facs="003"> f. iv(erso) upper right</locus><desc><ref type="authFile" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/AT1099StMary">St Mary</ref> and <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS3725Elizabet">ʾElsābeṭ</persName></desc></decoNote>
                                      <decoNote type="miniature" xml:id="d3"><locus target="#iv(erso)" facs="003"> f. iv(erso) bottom</locus><desc><ref type="authFile" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/AT1039Magi">The Three Magi</ref></desc></decoNote>
                                      <decoNote type="miniature" xml:id="d4"><locus target="#iir(ecto)" facs="004"> f. iir(ecto) top right</locus><desc>The Slaughter of the Innocents</desc></decoNote>
                                      <decoNote type="miniature" xml:id="d5"><locus target="#iir(ecto)" facs="004"> f. iir(ecto) bottom left</locus><desc><ref type="authFile" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/AT1016Flight">Flight into Egypt</ref></desc></decoNote>
                                      <decoNote type="miniature" xml:id="d6"><locus target="#iir(ecto)" facs="004"> f. iir(ecto) bottom right</locus><desc>The Holy Family with <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS5741Johnthe">St John the Baptist</persName> and <ref type="authFile" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/AT1082Angel">Angel</ref> with <term key="sword" ana="#sword"/> and <term key="scabbard" ana="#scabbard"/> behind them</desc></decoNote>
                                      <decoNote type="miniature" xml:id="d7"><locus target="#iiv(erso)" facs="005"> f. iiv(erso) top</locus><desc><ref type="authFile" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/AT1030Trinity">The Trinity</ref> surrounded by the Four Living Creatures</desc></decoNote>
                                      <decoNote type="miniature" xml:id="d8"><locus target="#iiv(erso)" facs="005"> f. iiv(erso) bottom</locus><desc>The Eleven Disciples with five open texts on book stands before them, i.e., they are learning the Gospel of the Kingdom</desc></decoNote>
                                      <decoNote type="miniature" xml:id="d9"><locus target="#iiir(ecto)" facs="006"> f. iiir(ecto) top</locus><desc><ref type="authFile" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/AT1099StMary">St Mary</ref> and <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS5684JesusCh">Jesus Christ</persName> seated center with <term key="angel" ana="#angel"/>s, two to the left and one to the right behind them and two smaller figures (<persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS3417David">David</persName> and <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS1269Abraham">ʾAbrǝhāmAbraham</persName>) before them, one to the right, one to the left</desc></decoNote>
                                      <decoNote type="miniature" xml:id="d10"><locus target="#iiir(ecto)" facs="006"> f. iiir(ecto) bottom</locus><desc>The apostles taking the body of the Blessed Virgin and the Jews interfering.  Kneeling figure at center (a Jew), has his amputated hands rising above him, two <ref type="authFile" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/AT1082Angel">Angel</ref>s standing over a canopy. To the left a crowd. To the right another crowd of nine figures. This conforms to a scene in one of the Miracles of Mary: How the angel of God cut the hand of Tawǝfanya when he tried to burn the body of Mary</desc></decoNote>
                                      <decoNote type="miniature" xml:id="d11"><locus target="#iiiv(erso)" facs="007"/><desc>Four <ref type="authFile" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/AT1012Equestrian">Equestrian Saint</ref>s</desc></decoNote>
                                      <decoNote type="miniature" xml:id="d12"><locus target="#ivr(ecto)" facs="008"/><desc>Four <ref type="authFile" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/AT1012Equestrian">Equestrian Saint</ref> Royal (crowns) Saints (halos)</desc></decoNote>
                                      <decoNote type="miniature" xml:id="d13"><locus target="#ivv(erso)" facs="009"> f. ivv(erso) upper left</locus><desc>Abunä Samu'el <ref type="authFile" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/AT1118AbunaSamuel">AT1118AbunaSamuel</ref> riding the lion</desc></decoNote>
                                      <decoNote type="miniature" xml:id="d14"><locus target="#ivv(erso)" facs="009"> f. ivv(erso) upper right</locus><desc><ref type="authFile" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/AT1035HolyMan">Holy Man Portrait</ref> <name ref="PRS4306GabraMa"/></desc></decoNote>
                                      <decoNote type="miniature" xml:id="d15"><locus target="#ivv(erso)" facs="009"> f. ivv(erso) bottom left</locus><desc><ref type="authFile" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/AT1120AbunaAragawi">AT1120AbunaAragawi</ref>, founder of Däbrä Damo</desc></decoNote>
                                      <decoNote type="miniature" xml:id="d16"><locus target="#iiv(erso)" facs="009"> f. ivv(erso) bottom right</locus><desc><ref type="authFile" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/AT1035HolyMan">Holy Man Portrait</ref> <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS9162TaklaHa">Takla Hāymānot</persName></desc></decoNote>
                                      <decoNote type="miniature" xml:id="d17"><locus target="#vr(ecto)" facs="010"> f. vr(ecto) top</locus><desc>Two <ref type="authFile" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/AT1041HolyMen">Holy Men Potrait</ref> (right) before a crowd (left)</desc></decoNote>
                                      <decoNote type="miniature" xml:id="d18"><locus target="#vr(ecto)" facs="010"> f. vr(ecto) bottom</locus><desc>Two <ref type="authFile" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/AT1041HolyMen">Holy Men Potrait</ref> (left) before a crowd (right)</desc></decoNote>
                                      <decoNote type="miniature" xml:id="d19"><locus target="#vv(erso)" facs="011"> f. vv(erso) top</locus><desc><ref type="authFile" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/AT1067LastSupper">The Last Supper</ref></desc></decoNote>
                                      <decoNote type="miniature" xml:id="d20"><locus target="#vv(erso)" facs="011"> f. vv(erso) bottom</locus><desc>Five <ref type="authFile" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/AT1041HolyMen">Holy Men Potrait</ref> with two doves hovering between the two on the left. Perhaps, Pentecost</desc></decoNote>
                                      <decoNote type="miniature" xml:id="d21"><locus target="#vir(ecto)" facs="012"> f. vir(ecto) top</locus><desc>Foot Washing Ceremony</desc></decoNote>
                                      <decoNote type="miniature" xml:id="d22"><locus target="#vir(ecto)" facs="012"> f. vir(ecto) bottom</locus><desc><ref type="authFile" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/AT1099StMary">St Mary</ref> washes <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS5684JesusCh">Jesus Christ</persName>’ feet</desc></decoNote>
                                      <decoNote type="miniature" xml:id="d23"><locus target="#viv(erso)" facs="013"> f. viv(erso) top</locus><desc><ref type="authFile" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/AT1070JesushealstheBlind">Jesus Heals the Blind</ref> before a crowd</desc></decoNote>
                                      <decoNote type="miniature" xml:id="d24"><locus target="#viv(erso)" facs="013"> f. viv(erso) bottom</locus><desc>Bringing the paralytic to be healed</desc></decoNote>
                                      <decoNote type="miniature" xml:id="d25"><locus target="#viir(ecto)" facs="014"> f. vii(recto) top</locus><desc><ref type="authFile" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/AT1070JesushealstheBlind">Jesus Heals the Blind</ref> before a crowd</desc></decoNote>
                                      <decoNote type="miniature" xml:id="d26"><locus target="#vii(recto)" facs="014"> f. vii(recto) bottom</locus><desc>Man (center, Jairus?) kneels before <ref type="authFile" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/AT1084JesusChrist">JesusChrist</ref> and another saint (left) and a crowd stands to the right</desc></decoNote>
                                      <decoNote type="miniature" xml:id="d27"><locus target="#viiv(erso)" facs="015"> f. viiv(erso) top</locus><desc><ref type="authFile" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/AT1049Resurrection">Resurrection of Jesus</ref>, raising <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS1386Adam">Adam</persName> and <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS3926Eve">Eve</persName></desc></decoNote>
                                      <decoNote type="miniature" xml:id="d28"><locus target="#viiv(erso)" facs="015"> f. viiv(erso) bottom</locus><desc>Two <ref type="authFile" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/AT1012Equestrian">Equestrian Saint</ref>s</desc></decoNote>
